#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:3
#: a7c7096d1f6348c18a391ece6ba0acda
msgid "磁矩旋转（Magmom Rotation）"
msgstr "Magnetic-Moment Rotation (Magmom Rotation)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:5
#: a1542fbe214a47a79df548b4cfad42e8
msgid "`Group`: `Perturbation` | `Class`: `MagneticMomentRotationCard`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:7
#: 99297ebc6f544e96aaf6d4fb0482e11d
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "What the card does"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:9
#: f0e414c126b5493c8934ebc53aacf222
msgid "对已存在的磁矩做随机小角度旋转，并可选地扰动模长。每个输入结构输出多个旋转版本，用于补充自旋方向附近的连续构型邻域数据。"
msgstr ""
"Apply random small-angle rotations to existing moments and optionally "
"perturb their magnitudes. Multiple variants per input provide continuous "
"local coverage around a reference spin direction."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:11
#: a637a537a9df4a6ab76723a4f60d2659
msgid ""
"\\mathbf{m}'=\\lambda\\,\\mathbf{R}(\\hat{\\mathbf{n}},\\theta)\\,\\mathbf{m},\\quad"
" \\lambda\\in[f_{\\min},f_{\\max}]"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:13
#: b5fde73e2fc14af8ac819a083913b096
msgid "**关键限制：** 这张卡只做随机旋转和模长缩放，不改变晶体结构，不定义新的磁序。它依赖输入已有 `initial_magmoms`。"
msgstr ""
"**Scope:** This card only rotates and rescales moments. It neither changes "
"atomic geometry nor defines a new magnetic order, and it requires existing "
"`initial_magmoms`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:15
#: 7732e1d8c6a84ebe80c3f99312b306cf
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example workflow"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:17
#: f6592b58233a45e78b9b6b6323ec9027
msgid "场景：模型在 MD 中遇到自旋方向涨落就崩"
msgstr "Scenario: model errors rise sharply when spin directions fluctuate during MD"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:19
#: c2add47bef114899aa5d55f8bd8bda6b
msgid ""
"你训练了一个 NEP 磁性模型，所有训练数据里磁矩方向都是严格对齐的（FM 全同向、AFM 严格翻转）。静态推理表现完美，但一跑有限温度 "
"MD——原子磁矩受热涨落发生 5~10 度的小角度偏转——力的误差直接翻倍。"
msgstr ""
"You trained a magnetic NEP model using only perfectly aligned moments: "
"parallel in FM states and exactly reversed in AFM states. Static predictions"
" are accurate, but in finite-temperature MD a 5–10° thermal deflection of "
"local moments doubles the force error."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:21
#: 9d18849a646a4c10b726802e458b3e5f
msgid ""
"**诊断思路：** "
"训练集只覆盖了磁矩方向空间的离散点，模型在这些点之间只能外推。需要在每个参考磁态周围加一批小角度旋转样本，让模型\"见过\"自旋在参考方向附近连续变化的环境。"
msgstr ""
"**Diagnosis:** The training set covers only isolated points in moment-"
"direction space, forcing interpolation gaps to behave like extrapolation. "
"Add small-angle samples around each reference state so the model learns a "
"continuous neighborhood of spin orientations."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:23
#: 55d738b9e61748e6abe16a9fb0a54481
msgid ""
"**输入：** 一个已写入 `initial_magmoms` 的磁性结构（来自 `Magnetic Order` 或 `Set Magnetic "
"Moments` 的上游输出）"
msgstr ""
"**Input:** A magnetic structure with `initial_magmoms`, typically produced "
"by `Magnetic Order` or `Set Magnetic Moments`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:25
#: 0167a88fabd44ba9b758df347d58a292
msgid "**目标：** 对每个输入帧生成 5 个旋转版本，最大旋转角 10 度，模长扰动 ±5%，覆盖自旋方向附近的连续邻域"
msgstr ""
"**Goal:** Generate five variants per input with rotations up to 10° and "
"magnitude scaling of ±5%, covering a local neighborhood around each "
"reference direction."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:27
#: 78f6d47357944e548c1b1fb536fe6be7
msgid "**参数设置：**"
msgstr "**Parameters:**"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:28
#: 2533e5d63b994228917494cdbb47c10e
msgid "`Max Angle` = `10.0`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:29
#: 46e4130895ab435aac26da37edd6d086
msgid "`Num Structures` = `5`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:30
#: d379fb1c004d47b0bbe61e057fb56a45
msgid "`Disturb Magnitude` = 勾选，`Magnitude Factor` = `[0.95, 1.05]`"
msgstr "Enable `Disturb Magnitude` and set `Magnitude Factor` to `[0.95, 1.05]`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:32
#: 5dd5d606fa3142d3a4d9b2d020a97978
msgid "**输出：** 每输入帧 5 个结构，磁矩方向在 0~10 度范围内随机偏离，模长在 95%~105% 之间浮动。原子位置不变。"
msgstr ""
"**Output:** Five structures per input. Moment directions are randomly "
"deflected by 0–10°, magnitudes are scaled to 95–105%, and atomic positions "
"are unchanged."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:34
#: a8fed02f4a0a424db4937edbd7833442
msgid "**怎么验证训练集质量改善：**"
msgstr "**How to verify that training-set quality improved:**"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:35
#: 15842e1da7da4b90b54c8b089139e293
msgid "重训后跑有限温度 MD，检查力的 MAE 是否比之前更稳定"
msgstr ""
"After DFT labeling and retraining, rerun the finite-temperature validation "
"and check whether force MAE remains stable under directional fluctuations."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:36
#: 9a9f64d960da4612ae1d239c49bade37
msgid "如果仍有方向敏感性问题，增大 `Max Angle` 到 15~20 度，或增加 `Num Structures`"
msgstr ""
"If directional sensitivity remains, increase `Max Angle` to 15–20° or "
"increase `Num Structures`, then re-evaluate held-out angular slices."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:37
#: b6b33cb55057454c828a2d06ef3176e9
msgid "如果特定元素的磁矩扰动后偏离物理合理范围，用 `Elements` 限制只扰动目标元素"
msgstr ""
"If perturbing a particular species produces implausible moments, use "
"`Elements` to restrict the operation to the intended magnetic sublattice."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:39
#: a33cd3f277e14444883c86464df233fd
msgid "什么时候加这张卡、什么时候不加"
msgstr "When to add this card"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:41
#: 0275180250b14b198aba66af91fadc2d
msgid "**加：**"
msgstr "**Add it when:**"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:42
#: 234c44e7d66547bbb981a47c641eac8a
msgid "训练集只有固定方向的磁态，模型对方向涨落敏感"
msgstr ""
"The training set contains only fixed magnetic directions and the model is "
"sensitive to directional fluctuations."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:43
#: 231f1cda689b4c158c69ed52eb297f23
msgid "做有限温度 MD 或自旋动力学，需要连续的方向覆盖"
msgstr ""
"Finite-temperature MD or spin dynamics requires continuous directional "
"coverage."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:44
#: 2440cafa126547bcb640eb891cae47f0
msgid "上游已有可信磁矩，只需在附近做小幅度采样"
msgstr ""
"The upstream moments are trusted and only local sampling around them is "
"needed."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:46
#: 6759a342a602471393bb9ccb2831cdfa
msgid "**不加：**"
msgstr "**Do not add it when:**"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:47
#: 2550938f66004e15ba295642b57a8961
msgid "输入没有初始磁矩 → 先用 `Set Magnetic Moments` 或 `Magnetic Order`"
msgstr ""
"The input has no moments → use `Set Magnetic Moments` or `Magnetic Order` "
"first."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:48
#: 3b97273f7d8c4e5598f414ea23e19b88
msgid "需要方向大范围覆盖（40°+）→ 用 `Small-Angle Spin Tilt` 确定性扫描"
msgstr ""
"You need broad angular coverage of 40° or more → use a deterministic `Small-"
"Angle Spin Tilt` scan."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:49
#: 23043a822cd94480ba5f374530fa3b93
msgid "只需要模长扰动不需要方向变化 → 这张卡的旋转功能白费了"
msgstr ""
"Only magnitude variation is needed → choose a workflow that does not "
"introduce unnecessary rotations."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:51
#: eba22b3731c04684908659261b2fc22b
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:53
#: 950b623df33d4f3da80696f9d8f7fd99
msgid "Elements（elements）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:55
#: fe62339ab41d45a1ac0962e58e3991c7
msgid "`str`，默认 `''`。逗号分隔的元素列表，如 `Fe,Co`——只对列出的元素做旋转和模长扰动。留空则全部磁性原子参与。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default: `''`. Comma-separated symbols such as `Fe,Co`. Only listed "
"elements are rotated and rescaled; leave empty to include all atoms with "
"nonzero moments."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:57
#: 83ee05756ab04f899203bec38388b160
msgid "Max Angle（max_angle）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:59
#: cfe79f1cc5794016a4e9629c669f6419
msgid "`float`，默认 `10.0`。最大旋转角，单位度。每次随机采样角度在 [0, max_angle] 内均匀分布。"
msgstr ""
"`float`, default: `10.0`. Maximum rotation angle in degrees. Each rotation "
"angle is sampled uniformly from `[0, max_angle]`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:60
#: c95ec31392854d3f8711d2a9519f86f3
msgid "保守：2~5°（验证方向变化确实有帮助）"
msgstr "Conservative: 2–5° (verify that directional augmentation is useful)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:61
#: bf2114c40d2143bbbb1900e06baf5ef3
msgid "平衡：8~15°（常规有限温度覆盖）"
msgstr "Balanced: 8–15° (routine finite-temperature coverage)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:62
#: 8470bb0bdea94418af2f291bcf9cc7e4
msgid "探索：20°+（宽温度区间，需重点抽查）"
msgstr "Exploratory: 20° or more (broad angular coverage; inspect carefully)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:64
#: 769c2f61d72d4ef9898dbcfc49999fcc
msgid "Num Structures（num_structures）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:66
#: 34d52819238046adb6e0754b13af98c3
msgid "`int`，默认 `5`。每输入帧输出的旋转版本数。5~10 用于轻量补样，10~30 常规覆盖，30+ 建议后接过滤。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default: `5`. Number of rotated variants per input frame. Use 5–10 "
"for lightweight augmentation and 10–30 for routine coverage. For more than "
"30, follow with representative filtering."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:68
#: 4bf7ebc06b6948ce88ae6f5d677d15cb
msgid "Lift Scalar（lift_scalar）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:70
#: ea4dc9c51e0a4608837af9472521c6e5
msgid "`bool`，默认 `True`。输入是共线标量磁矩时，是否先沿 `Axis` 抬升为向量再做旋转。输入是标量且需要旋转时必须开启。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default: `True`. Lift collinear scalar moments to vectors along "
"`Axis` before rotation. This must be enabled when scalar input is to be "
"rotated."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:72
#: c64aa6b7ead54b7a9e2933d79af76a37
msgid "Axis（axis）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:74
#: 33554b0ef6324b99abedc9108f95cc29
msgid ""
"`list[float] | tuple[float, float, float]`，默认 `(0.0, 0.0, "
"1.0)`。`lift_scalar` 抬升时使用的参考方向。输入已经是向量磁矩时此参数对初始方向无影响。"
msgstr ""
"`list[float] | tuple[float, float, float]`, default: `(0.0, 0.0, 1.0)`. "
"Reference direction used by `lift_scalar`. It does not alter the initial "
"direction of vector-valued input moments."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:76
#: c0f7ddf60027496da8674d57454ab23f
msgid "生效条件：涉及方向、分层、表面或向量初始化的模式都会使用。"
msgstr ""
"Used by modes that depend on a direction, layering, a surface, or vector "
"initialization."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:78
#: 80d16f4230e7409bb528359df4fa7cdf
msgid "Disturb Magnitude（disturb_magnitude）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:80
#: 41be6e9e07f14ec69fe6612181d69ea4
msgid "`bool`，默认 `True`。旋转的同时随机缩放磁矩模长。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default: `True`. Randomly rescale moment magnitudes while rotating "
"them."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:82
#: fc647155936240ff881326237bfd78a6
msgid "Magnitude Factor（magnitude_factor）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:84
#: 7a1fabff5a0640e390f144c5a5420d68
msgid ""
"`list[float] | tuple[float, float]`，默认 `(0.95, 1.05)`。`[min, max]` "
"格式的模长缩放因子区间。"
msgstr ""
"`list[float] | tuple[float, float]`, default: `(0.95, 1.05)`. Magnitude "
"scale-factor range expressed as `[minimum, maximum]`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:85
#: 721069ab53a245099883c8133e3178e3
msgid "保守：`[0.98, 1.02]`"
msgstr "Conservative: `[0.98, 1.02]`"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:86
#: f4b1f278a6c445c6abe47ebf7a7cf908
msgid "平衡：`[0.95, 1.05]`"
msgstr "Balanced: `[0.95, 1.05]`"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:87
#: fcd29df2ca814a18a83f209eb2c3026e
msgid "探索：`[0.85, 1.15]`"
msgstr "Exploratory: `[0.85, 1.15]`"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:89
#: db9993f36aa74d259d921c49f23595cf
msgid "Use Seed（use_seed）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:91
#: 334c28b3d1734befba2f90484e4691ab
msgid "`bool`，默认 `False`。勾选后固定种子可复现。对比实验时开，纯探索可以关。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default: `False`. Enable with a fixed seed for reproducibility. Use "
"it for controlled comparisons; leave it off during exploration."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:93
#: a0d1ab689c87490aa3b90d957314ea74
msgid "Seed（seed）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:95
#: 42d5144ba8ec48ce825d55d6cccfcdfb
msgid "`int`，默认 `0`。种子值。"
msgstr "`int`, default: `0`. Random seed."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:97
#: c0700fccaaaa40398fe652ce7a6d044f
msgid "生效条件：`use_seed=True`。"
msgstr "Active only when `use_seed=True`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:99
#: bae6909c1d9a4ec4b6e3ce8199e286e3
msgid "推荐预设"
msgstr "Recommended presets"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:101
#: 9a444d998b454672be42322b60eb3f00
msgid "方向微扰验证（5 个输出/帧，适合初步诊断）"
msgstr "Directional-perturbation check (5 outputs per frame)"

