#: 9763fdecfb7545bab5a716ba24b24420
msgid "方向 + 模长常规覆盖（10 个输出/帧，适合有限温度 MD）"
msgstr ""
"Routine direction-and-magnitude coverage (10 outputs per frame; suitable for"
