#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:152
#: 122ec21a0ea0451095851ae57c158e9f
msgid "推荐组合"
msgstr "Recommended combinations"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:154
#: 58ddd1409dc24e4589b2a052372c5e35
msgid "`Magnetic Order` → `Magmom Rotation`：先生成 FM/AFM 参考态，再补方向邻域"
msgstr ""
"`Magnetic Order` → `Magmom Rotation`: generate FM/AFM reference states, then"
" sample their directional neighborhoods."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:155
#: e165d9f8bc8b4d5ba9e0b83e530ba8d6
msgid "`Set Magnetic Moments` → `Magmom Rotation`：先统一磁矩格式，再旋转"
msgstr ""
"`Set Magnetic Moments` → `Magmom Rotation`: standardize the moment "
"representation, then rotate."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:156
#: 89b71a3b455f4808adb6e7c46f9f23b4
msgid "`Magmom Rotation` → `FPS Filter`：生成大量版本后用 FPS 筛选代表性样本"
msgstr ""
"`Magmom Rotation` → `FPS Filter`: select representative samples after "
"generating many variants."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:158
#: d3a0a81a0cfc402d963952c65cd704bb
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Common questions"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:160
#: e828b306814c471cb1fc895348232056
msgid ""
"**输出和输入一样。** 检查输入是否有 `initial_magmoms`。标量磁矩需开 `Lift Scalar`。`Max Angle` 不能为 "
"0。"
msgstr ""
"**The output is unchanged.** Confirm that the input has `initial_magmoms`, "
"enable `Lift Scalar` for scalar moments, and ensure `Max Angle` is nonzero."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:162
#: cd4b1dfe5d4146feb7c9cc2307e112a5
msgid "**输出磁矩全是零。** `Elements` 过滤掉了所有有磁矩的元素，或 `Magnitude Factor` 下限为 0 且被采样到。"
msgstr ""
"**All output moments are zero.** `Elements` may exclude every magnetic "
"species, or the magnitude-factor range may include zero. Correct the element"
" scope and scaling interval."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:164
#: 90f38065f0f9422aa3323c46e1265d0c
msgid "**每次运行结果不同。** 未开启 `Use Seed`。需要可复现时勾选并固定 `Seed`。"
msgstr ""
"**Results differ between runs.** Enable `Use Seed` and fix `Seed` for "
"reproducibility."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:166
#: 21889e1b780746afacc66985bd16cdd8
msgid "输出标签"
msgstr "Output labels"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:168
#: c5d15ee7d0da4014bcad7616bd8059c1
msgid "`MMR(a=10.0,s=0.95-1.05)`：向量旋转 + 模长扰动同时开启"
msgstr "`MMR(a=10.0,s=0.95-1.05)`: vector rotation with magnitude perturbation"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:169
#: 3f2f581c73c54ae5b39dca4487899964
msgid "`MMS(s=0.95-1.05)`：仅模长缩放（旋转角度为 0 或无向量输入）"
msgstr ""
"`MMS(s=0.95-1.05)`: magnitude scaling only, when the rotation angle is zero "
"or vector input is unavailable"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:171
#: 3742e36873764796992704051a184207
msgid "所有输出写入 `initial_magmoms` 数组。"
msgstr "All outputs are written to the `initial_magmoms` array."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:173
#: 7e8eb8df0ad74bc2bfac1d95578f90cb
msgid "可复现性"
msgstr "Reproducibility"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magmom-rotation-card.md:175
#: cdf9ef396c114cc7924a3ef6b840e5a8
msgid "勾选 `use_seed` + 固定 `seed` → 相同输入可复现。每次旋转的随机轴和角度由 seed + 结构序号联合控制。"
msgstr ""
"Enable `use_seed` and fix `seed` to reproduce the same result for the same "
"input. Each random axis and angle is determined jointly by the seed and "
"structure index."
